<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cable Design raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cable Design raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its intermediate-term rating on Cable Design Technologies Corp to accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/2 to 31.</p>
